   {{{\left( { - 1} \right)}^{n + 2}}a} &amp; {{{\left( { - 1} \right)}^{n + 1}}b} &amp; {{{\left( { - 1} \right)}^n}c}  \cr 

 } } \right| = 0$$



then the value of $$n$$ :

explanation:
$$\left| {\matrix{
   a &amp; {a + 1} &amp; {a - 1}  \cr 
   { - b} &amp; {b + 1} &amp; {b - 1}  \cr 
   c &amp; {c - 1} &amp; {c + 1}  \cr 

 } } \right| + \left| {\matrix{
