 } } \right| = 0$$


$$\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,\,{C_2} - {C_1},{C_3} - {C_1}$$


$$ \Rightarrow \left[ {1 + {{\left( { - 1} \right)}^{n + 2}}} \right]\left| {\matrix{
