= y$$\left[ {\left( {y + {\omega ^2} - \omega } \right)\left( {y + \omega  - {\omega ^2}} \right) - \left( {1 - {\omega ^2}} \right)\left( {1 - \omega } \right)} \right]$$


= y(y2) = y3

