   2 &amp; 4  \cr 
   4 &amp; { - 1}  \cr 

 } } \right]$$


$$B = {1 \over 2}\left( {\left[ {\matrix{
   2 &amp; 3  \cr 
   5 &amp; { - 1}  \cr 

 } } \right] - \left[ {\matrix{
   2 &amp; 5  \cr 
   3 &amp; { - 1}  \cr 

 } } \right]} \right) = \left[ {\matrix{
   0 &amp; { - 1}  \cr 
   1 &amp; 0  \cr 

 } } \right]$$


So $$AB = \left( {\left[ {\matrix{
