   {4\lambda } &amp; 0 &amp; {2\lambda }  \cr 

 } } \right| = 2$$

$$ \Rightarrow 1(4{\lambda ^2} - 4{\lambda ^2} + 2\lambda ) = 2$$

$$ \Rightarrow {\lambda ^2} = 1$$

