 } } \right]$$, where $$\alpha$$ is a non-zero real number an $$N = \sum\limits_{k = 1}^{49} {{M^{2k}}} $$. If $$(I - {M^2})N =  - 2I$$, then the positive integral value of $$\alpha$$ is ____________.

Let $$A = \left( {\matrix{
   {1 + i} & 1  \cr 
   { - i} & 0  \cr 

 } } \right)$$ where $$i = \sqrt { - 1} $$. Then, the number of elements in the set { n $$\in$$ {1, 2, ......, 100} : An = A } is ____________.

explanation:
$$\therefore$$ $${A^2} = \left[ {\matrix{
   {1 + i} & 1  \cr 
   { - i} & 0  \cr 

 } } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
   {1 + i} & 1  \cr 
   { - 1} & 0  \cr 

 } } \right] = \left[ {\matrix{
   i & {1 + i}  \cr 
   {1 - i} & { - i}  \cr 

 } } \right]$$
$${A^4} = \left[ {\matrix{
   i & {1 + i}  \cr 
   {1 - i} & { - i}  \cr 

 } } \right]\left[ {\matrix{
