&amp; \quad \lambda=36 \mathrm{~m} \\\\
&amp; U=f\lambda=500 \mathrm{~Hz} \times 36 \\\\
&amp; =18000 \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{s} \\\\
&amp; =18 \mathrm{~km} / \mathrm{s}
